  },
  {
   "id": "eW0WkXfa",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 105,
   "y": 5108,
   "width": 1720.3125,
   "height": 30,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#172554",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1.6,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "b99",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1290574812,
   "version": 5,
   "versionNonce": 97751325,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1794627770585,
   "created": 1794627598573,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "① IR：只在私有 clone 编辑；Finalizer 成功才提交。  ② 制品：私有 attempt → worker 正常退出 → 验证 + guard/契约绑定 → 原子发布。",
   "rawText": "① IR：只在私有 clone 编辑；Finalizer 成功才提交。  ② 制品：私有 attempt → worker 正常退出 → 验证 + guard/契约绑定 → 原子发布。",
   "fontSize": 25,
   "baseFontSize": null,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "① IR：只在私有 clone 编辑；Finalizer 成功才提交。  ② 制品：私有 attempt → worker 正常退出 → 验证 + guard/契约绑定 → 原子发布。",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.2,
   "labelPosition": null,
   "hasTextLink": false
  },
  {
   "id": "7OfjOcCj",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 105,
   "y": 5156,
   "width": 1330.0,
   "height": 30.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#172554",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1.6,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "b9A",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 983605220,
   "version": 5,
   "versionNonce": 110917489,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1794627770585,
   "created": 1794627598573,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "能力不适用时运行 F1。已改写布局发生明确 UB 超额时只重试一次语义合并。内部错误、超时、信号或坏制品均报错。",
   "rawText": "能力不适用时运行 F1。已改写布局发生明确 UB 超额时只重试一次语义合并。内部错误、超时、信号或坏制品均报错。",
   "fontSize": 25,
   "baseFontSize": null,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "能力不适用时运行 F1。已改写布局发生明确 UB 超额时只重试一次语义合并。内部错误、超时、信号或坏制品均报错。",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.2,
   "labelPosition": null,
   "hasTextLink": false
  },
  {
   "id": "LZjl3TG3",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 105,
   "y": 5204,
   "width": 944.9999999999999,
   "height": 30.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#172554",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
